veilid is a tool-only package. It installs these executables under tools/veilid:

    veilid-server
    veilid-cli

Vcpkg adds this directory to PATH for consumers. There is no CMake target.

Only Linux glibc x64 and arm64 are packaged. The systemd unit and the /etc
configuration files from the official Debian packages are intentionally not
installed.
